      "created_at": "2025-08-19T23:08:00.686Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/nickon\">@nickon</a></p>\n<p>Please bring in item group first in your quotation item table.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/4/4447669e36e8c1a6dc4bd5e74532400e517fdef1.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/4447669e36e8c1a6dc4bd5e74532400e517fdef1\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/4/4447669e36e8c1a6dc4bd5e74532400e517fdef1_2_690x310.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"9K1rveC2NGtVQRwm7PHEUHiK0eZ\" width=\"690\" height=\"310\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/4/4447669e36e8c1a6dc4bd5e74532400e517fdef1_2_690x310.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/4/4447669e36e8c1a6dc4bd5e74532400e517fdef1_2_1035x465.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/4/4447669e36e8c1a6dc4bd5e74532400e517fdef1_2_1380x620.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F7F1\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1898×855 78 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>and then handle grouping based on item group within your print format html / jinja code.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/7/07bd52be10faa57f27c8724d123854f8ebfe9591.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/07bd52be10faa57f27c8724d123854f8ebfe9591\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/7/07bd52be10faa57f27c8724d123854f8ebfe9591_2_622x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"16sXR1bx24mmlmctLgXQqRpWejv\" widt